      "content": "it doesn't really feel like an emergency though. like i don't feel dizzy or anything and the headache is pretty mild. i'm kinda dreading the ER because of the wait times and the cost... if i just take some extra tylenol and sleep it off, would that be okay? or is it really that big of a deal if i'm not seeing any symptoms like blurry vision yet?",
